<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDS target lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDS target lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it lowered its 12-month target price on Electronic Data Systems Corp to $42 per share from $46.</p>
<p>-- Kept neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Actions followed EDS's release of disappointing third quarter earnings, &quot;the third major earnings disappointment in the last four quarters,&quot; Lehman said in a research note.</p>
</text>
